    {
        "slide_number": 2,
        "title": "COMPANY",
        "text_blocks": [
            {
                "text": "Exentropic Ideas",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "About",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "EXENTROPIC IDEAS",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Linking First-Principles with Industrial Intelligence",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Founded in 2025, we are based  in London, Canada. We engineer next-generation, AI-powered, purpose-built solutions to meet the complex demands of the Hydrocarbon Processing Industries (HPI). We empower heavy industrial facilities to transition from reactive monitoring to autonomous, predictive optimization.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Industry Verticals",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Our intelligent software suites are engineered to scale across a diverse spectrum of energy, chemical, and processing infrastructure:",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Petroleum Refining",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Petrochemicals",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Gas Processing",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "LNG Liquefaction/Regasification",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Power Plants",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Carbon Capture",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Green Hydrogen",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Solutions",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "We deliver deep-tech solutions that transform raw plant data into actionable, automated operational guardrails.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Force-X | Hybrid Digital Twins",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "The fusion of physics-based modeling and deep learning. Force-X maps first-principles thermodynamics and fluid dynamics against real-time sensor streams to provide unmatched predictive insight and asset optimization.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "OmniPlant-AX | Autonomous Manufacturing",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Moving past standard automation. OmniPlant-X introduces closed-loop, self-operating capabilities to maximize plant efficiency, safety, and yield with minimal human intervention. This includes plant start-ups, shut-downs, emergency and alarm management.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Hazop-X | Process Hazard Analyses",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "AI-driven safety infrastructure. Hazop-X modernizes operational risk assessment, continuously evaluating potential vulnerabilities to ensure world-class process safety management.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            }
        ],
