            {
                "text": "LOGIN",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "HAZOP-x was our pilot project to test the capabilities of various Large Language Models",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "We tested different LLMs and chose Google Gemini to launch our HAZOP-x",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "We just wrote the script to generate the report. Gemini does all the thinking.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "It is a completely (100%) free service. Nobody from Exentropic Ideas will follow up after you sign up.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Just contact us to create an account. You will get a 90-day temporary account ID and a password.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Use the account ID and the password to LOGIN (Button on the left of this text box)",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "You can follow the instructions and generate your own HAZOP reports.",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "We will very much appreciate your feedback. It will help us in upgrading HAZOP-x",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            },
            {
                "text": "Contact US",
                "level": 0,
                "is_bullet": false
            }
